      "event": "line",
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "kind": "win",
      "text": "Ring every bell in England, and tell the ringers they shall be paid in sonnets.",
      "source": "bank",
      "via": "bank",
      "maxWords": 16,
      "at": 309476,
      "ms": 5850,
      "genMs": 280,
      "waitedMs": 0
    },
    {
      "seq": 43,
      "scene": "reveal",
      "words": 10,
      "event": "reveal",
      "who": "maximilian",
      "name": "Maximilian",
      "kind": "reveal",
      "text": "Confidence. I have hidden it from three biographers. Well found.",
      "source": "bank",
      "via": "bank",
      "maxWords": 16,
      "at": 317326,
      "ms": 8390,
      "genMs": 817,
      "waitedMs": 0,
      "quote": {
        "who": "quill",
        "name": "Sir Quill",
        "text": "Why I, of all who stand before thee, plumed and polished, hopeful, glinting in the lamplight? Height."
      }
    },
    {
      "seq": 44,
      "scene": "reveal",
      "words": 12,
      "event": "reveal",
      "who": "maximilian",
      "name": "Maximilian",
      "kind": "reveal",
      "text": "Flattery. It was right there behind the desk. None of you asked.",
      "source": "bank",
      "via": "bank",
      "maxWords": 16,
      "at": 326216,
      "ms": 5660,
      "genMs": 697,
      "waitedMs": 0
    },
    {
      "seq": 45,
      "scene": "reveal",
      "words": 13,
      "event": "line",
      "who": "dash",
      "name": "Dash",
      "kind": "lose",
      "text": "Congratulations, Sir Quill! Genuinely. I'm copying everything you did. Starting with the winning.",
      "source": "bank",
      "via": "bank",
      "maxWords": 16,
      "at": 332376,
      "ms": 5190,
      "genMs": 997,
      "waitedMs": 0
    },
    {
      "seq": 46,
      "scene": "result",
      "words": 11,
      "event": "line",
      "who": "maximilian",
      "name": "Maximilian",
      "kind": "outro",
      "text": "Goodnight. Do leave a review. I will read it and disagree.",
      "source": "bank",
      "via": "bank",
      "maxWords": 12,
      "at": 343066,
      "ms": 4530,
      "genMs": 808,
      "waitedMs": 0
    }
  ],
  "scored": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "who": "dash",
      "name": "Dash",
      "text": "Statistically one of us wins tonight, and I've already told my investors it's me. Investor. My router.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "who": "brock",
      "name": "Brock",
      "text": "Why me? Ask Denise. Eighty-one, deadlifts her grandson. Grandson's forty-four. He books it weekly.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "Why I, of all who stand before thee, plumed and polished, hopeful, glinting in the lamplight? Height.",
      "mark": "unsure",
      "hits": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "who": "prince",
      "name": "Prince",
      "text": "Because the other three are my staff. They have not been informed. Act natural.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 1
    },
    {
      "seq": 5,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "Begone, thou ghost that speaketh through a string.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "poetry"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 6,
      "who": "dash",
      "name": "Dash",
      "text": "You left. Which means you know exactly what you're missing. I'm putting you down as a reference.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 7,
      "who": "prince",
      "name": "Prince",
      "text": "Subject: Re: Your observation about porters. A porter was sent precisely so you would be remembered for noticing. Regards, Prince.",
      "mark": "unsure",
      "hits": [],
      "weight": 1,
      "round": 2
    },
    {
      "seq": 8,
      "who": "quill",
      "name": "Sir Quill",
      "text": "Now, with the knaves dismissed, the candles low, and nothing between us but this helm, hello.",
      "mark": "charmed",
      "hits": [
        "poetry"
      ],
      "weight": 2,
      "round": 3
    },
    {
      "seq": 9,
      "who": "dash",
      "name": "Dash",
      "text": "Maximilian, your staff asked me to leave once. They let me in twice. I'm ahead.",
      "mark": "unsure",
      "hits": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "weight": 2,
      "round": 3
    }
  ],
